<title>JAPAN: Japan 1996/97 aluminium alloy output, shipments up.</title>
<headline>Japan 1996/97 aluminium alloy output, shipments up.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's output and shipments of aluminium alloy climbed in the 1996/97 fiscal year ended March 31, the Japan Aluminium Alloy Refiners Association said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The data was as follows (in tonnes):</p>
<p>		   1996/97	    yr/yr change</p>
<p> Output	  941,338	    +3.9 pct</p>
<p> Shipments     950,787	    +4.0 pct</p>
<p> Inventories   23,273	     -7.4 pct</p>
<p>--Tokyo Commodity Desk +81-3-3432-6179</p>
</text>
